{"id":"614170","name":"苹果山药饼","author":"沙儿飞飞❉","authorId":"9012879","desc":"","cover":"images/614170/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"山药","amount":"1颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"苹果","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"特棍山药去皮。","img":"images/614170/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"上锅蒸熟。","img":"images/614170/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"糖心苹果切开。","img":"images/614170/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"去皮切成丝","img":"images/614170/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"压成泥状。","img":"images/614170/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入苹果丝。","img":"images/614170/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量面粉。","img":"images/614170/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉成不粘手的面团。","img":"images/614170/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"电饼档刷油、放入饼。","img":"images/614170/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒上点芝麻。","img":"images/614170/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"压一压。","img":"images/614170/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煎至两面金黄即可。","img":"images/614170/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"健脾养胃.软糯香甜、非常好吃😋。","img":"images/614170/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"揉面时可以加一点水。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}